#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wifi-shield.rst:81
msgid ""
"The WINC1500's AP implementation accepts only one client at a time and "
"supports only ``OPEN`` and ``WEP`` security modes."
msgstr ""
"La implementación de AP del WINC1500 admite un solo cliente a la vez y solo "
"soporta los modos de seguridad ``OPEN`` y ``WEP``."

